  "$comment": "MK8 Mode asset sources (MK-93, ADR 0009). Metadata only: the pipeline never downloads. Put each model's extracted files in $MK8_RAW/models/<id>/ (default .mk8-raw/). assetId is the source site's asset id where known (null = not looked up yet). Optional per model: file (path of the OBJ or DAE inside its folder when there is more than one; a single .dae is preferred over a single .obj because it keeps skeletons), decoration (material-name regexes to simplify), collision (courses: false to skip the collision export). Sheets (MK-95): each sprite sheet's image at $MK8_RAW/<raw>; a raw ending in / is a folder (the extracted zip). No model exists on the site for fire-flower or crazy-8; Slim Tires and Paper Glider replace Roller Tires and Super Glider (none on the site).",
